# One line. Run from the repo root by `orgasmic verify TASK-M47E5.1`.
#
# `env -u ...` because a dispatch leaks its run id and home into subprocesses.
# The `--skip` is the one `orgasmic verify` requires of anything touching the
# drivers suite.
#
# NARROWED 2026-08-05 (TASK-M47E5.1.1.1). This artifact used to pin TWO
# behaviours. The first — "a summary file under the project dispatch dir must
# stay reachable" — was the WIDENING that TASK-M47E5.1's own review later ruled
# a BLOCK SHIP, and TASK-M47E5.1.1/.1.1.1 replaced it. Re-cutting that half
# would have re-asserted behaviour this project has since rejected, which is
# worse than losing the proof. Only the still-true half survives here; the
# finalize-grant scope is pinned by verify/TASK-M47E5.1.1.1/ instead.
env -u ORGASMIC_RUN_ID -u ORGASMIC_HOME cargo test -p orgasmic-drivers --lib -- --skip legacy_drivers_and_explicit_pairs_emit_equivalent_start_events a_dispatch_artifact_grant_refuses_when_no_project_root_is_configured
